# Fluent Mobile — project overview

Offline-first **Expo SDK 57** (React Native **0.86**, React **19.2.3**) companion for Bible translation recording. **Android-only permanently** — no iOS app (see [android-only.mdc](./android-only.mdc)). Uses **CNG** — native `android/` is generated via `expo prebuild --platform android`, not committed. Syncs Fluent API data into local SQLite (`op-sqlite`); UI reads from DB after sync.

## Key paths

- Entry: `index.js` → Expo Router `src/routes/` + `AuthSessionProvider` (DB init, session restore; sync post-login / via hooks)
- Routes: `src/routes/` (auth + app groups; settings Drawer)
- App config: `app.config.ts` (EAS project ID, plugins, package id)
- Stack screens: `src/app/screens/` (Home, Settings, Sync, Drafting, PrepareForOffline)
- Nested UI: `src/app/tabs/` (ProjectsTab, MyWorkTab, BibleTab, RecordTab, auth/legal)
- Navigation helpers: `src/navigation/` (auth session, hrefs, auth gate)
- Theme: `src/theme/` (canonical tokens for new UI)
- API: `src/services/api.ts` (`FluentAPI`)
- Sync: `src/services/sync.ts`
- DB writes: `src/db/repository.ts` | reads: `src/db/queries.ts`
- Types: `src/types/{api,db}/` (etc.); route hrefs/params: `src/navigation/hrefs.ts`, `routeParams.ts`
- Env: `EXPO_PUBLIC_API_BASE_URL` in `.env` (via `getApiBaseUrl()` in `src/config/apiBaseUrl.ts`)
- Native (generated): run `npm run prebuild` — regenerates `android/` only; do not commit `android/`
- Local native modules: `modules/` (`aac-remux`, `upload-sync-foreground`)
- Releases: tag `v*` → `.github/workflows/eas-build.yml` + `.eas/workflows/create-production-builds.yml` (Android only)

## Package manager

Use **npm** only (not pnpm/yarn).

